From 674df5474e16030077e53e3dd9535b4907c703ef Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: volodymyr-holovan <285621215+volodymyr-holovan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:07:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Final Castle: own models and animations, bug fixes

Own models for the Rune Sovereign, the Forge Harbinger and the rune ward (geometry and
textures generated together), glow layers, gestures that match what the bosses do (staff
levelled for a volley, struck down for a rune circle, arms flung up to call), the body
turned to the target, the Harbinger's state synced for its poses. Fixed: /kill on a stunned
boss left NaN health and absorption (an unkillable ghost), rune circles under players outside
the gazebo, a second ward wave leaving the first one behind.
